    "regime_notes": "Aggregate 10-day signal clears the benchmark gates, with positive performance in 2020-2022, 2025-2026, and the small 2029 YTD sample. It was weak or negative in 2023-2024 and 2027-2028; uncertainty is material because the cross-section has only 15 assets."
  },
